# Copy to .env next to compose.yaml on all four boxes, the same file on each. Unset, every option takes the image's
# setting (Dockerfile) or gr8's launcher default (gr8/KNOBS.md).

# --- the four boxes ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Without PEERS, each box finds the others through its local mentat daemon (gr8's default). Without mentat, uncomment
# these and fill them in, the same lines on every box. The head (first in PEERS) serves the API.
# Their 10G LAN addresses, head first.
#PEERS=<head-lan-ip>,<box2-lan-ip>,<box3-lan-ip>,<box4-lan-ip>
# Each box's ConnectX address on PCIe root 1 (IPS) and PCIe root 2 (IPS2), in PEERS order. Unset, each box finds its own.
#IPS=<head-root1-ip>,<box2-root1-ip>,<box3-root1-ip>,<box4-root1-ip>
#IPS2=<head-root2-ip>,<box2-root2-ip>,<box3-root2-ip>,<box4-root2-ip>
